%% Unsponsored transaction flow
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Dialog as Porto Dialog
    participant Relay as Porto Relay
    participant Account as Ithaca Account
    participant Chain as Gwyneth L1

    User->>Dialog: sendCalls(calls)
    Dialog-->>Relay: wallet_prepareCalls
    Relay-->>Relay: Quote gas (payer = user AA)
    Relay-->>Dialog: Return digest + fee meta
    Dialog->>User: Prompt for WebAuthn signature
    User-->>Dialog: Sign digest (AA key)
    Dialog-->>Relay: wallet_sendPreparedCalls
    Relay-->>Chain: Execute bundle (payer = user AA)
    Chain-->>Relay: Receipt (gas deducted from AA)
    Relay-->>Dialog: callsStatus = success
    Dialog-->>User: Success + balance update
